/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:49:   - Shapes remain thin 8-connected orthogonal blobs with one connector each, which preserves
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:54:   - Original overlap-at-connector logic is invalid because gravity landing is disjoint:
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:59:     * each connector is a single vertical bar;
/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:60:     * the base connector's body side uniquely determines from which side the plug slides;
